WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:05.200
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain an American science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.240
fiction action film called “Æon Flux.” 
Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:19.600
A deadly virus wiped out ninety-nine percent of&nbsp;
humanity in 2011. A person named Trevor Goodchild&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.360
finds a cure for the virus, and saves one percent&nbsp;
of the human population. The remaining one percent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:31.120
consists of five million surviving people who now&nbsp;
live in a city called Bregna. The premise of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:39.200
movie is set in 2415. Four hundred and four years&nbsp;
after the pandemic, the city of Bregna has changed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.480
completely. At first glance, it looks like&nbsp;
a perfect utopian city with happy people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:49.920
and a better quality of life. Massive concrete&nbsp;
walls surround the circular city to stop people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:55.520
from going outside the premises and potentially&nbsp;
catching the virus. Bregna is technologically&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.520 --> 00:01:01.520
advanced and has a massive spaceship-like&nbsp;
object levitating over the city. For the past&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:06.640
four hundred years, the Goodchild dynasty has&nbsp;
been ruling the city. However, the government&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:13.520
hides a secret from its people. Many people vanish&nbsp;
mysteriously and frequently, and no one knows why.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:18.320
Even weirder, is that the whole population gets&nbsp;
strange nightmares, and the government requests&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:23.520
it to be treated. Everyone suspects that it is the&nbsp;
government that is involved in the disappearances,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:28.240
but no one is brave enough to stand against the&nbsp;
Goodchilds, except for a group of people called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:33.840
the Monicans. Monicans is an underground rebel&nbsp;
organization that aims to get the answers to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:37.600
frequent disappearance and fight against&nbsp;
the absolute rule of the Goodchilds. 
&nbsp;

00:01:38.160 --> 00:01:42.400
The protagonist of the movie, Æon&nbsp;
Flux, is a highly skilled assassin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:46.800
and a warrior who works secretly with the&nbsp;
Monicans. At the beginning of the movie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.800 --> 00:01:51.360
we see her walking through the streets of the&nbsp;
beautiful city. She meets a man at a junction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:57.280
and the two kiss. We see the man transfer a pill&nbsp;
from his mouth to hers as they kiss. When the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.280 --> 00:02:03.440
separate and go their own way, Æon takes the&nbsp;
pill. It is an advanced telepathic technology&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:08.400
used by the Monicans to communicate with each&nbsp;
other. By taking the pill, Æon is able to talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:13.600
to the leader of the Monicans named Handler. She&nbsp;
provides her with a new mission, to sabotage the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:20.000
Goodchild’s central surveillance facility. Later,&nbsp;
we see Æon walk through a busy street in the city.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.800
An old man shows people a picture of his&nbsp;
daughter, asking if someone has seen her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:28.960
Æon meets her younger sister Una, and the&nbsp;
two plan to meet for dinner that night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.520 --> 00:02:34.320
After her meeting with Una, she goes to the&nbsp;
Goodchild’s headquarter, and very swiftly kills&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.760
the three guards outside. She goes further in and&nbsp;
defeats the other guards too. They do not match&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:45.520
Æon’s fighting and spying skills. She jumps inside&nbsp;
through the roof, and sees the life of every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.520 --> 00:02:51.360
person in the city being watched through some kind&nbsp;
of technology. Æon then plants a bug in the place&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:56.320
and completes her mission successfully. 
That night, Æon is going to Una’s apartment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:02.800
but on her way, she sees two men carrying her&nbsp;
body away. She is shocked and freezes in her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:08.080
tracks. Some guards bring Una’s boyfriends&nbsp;
behind her. He looks at Æon and tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:13.040
that Una wasn’t a Monican, suggesting that she was&nbsp;
killed for being misunderstood as a Monican. 
&nbsp;

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:18.080
Æon cannot stop thinking about her sister&nbsp;
at night, she pledges to take revenge on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:23.440
people who got her killed. A microphone embedded&nbsp;
permanently on her ear tells her that Handler&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:28.880
wants to see her. She uses telepathic technology&nbsp;
to meet the leader. She hands her a new mission,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.880 --> 00:03:34.240
the most important mission they have had yet. It&nbsp;
is to kill the man who made the cure and chairman&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:39.200
of the Goodchild’s rule, Trevor Goodchild. Æon&nbsp;
accepts the mission delightedly, because she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:44.160
is getting a chance to kill the murderer of her&nbsp;
sister. Handler blows her pollen from a flower,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:49.680
and embeds Æon with the plan of the mission.&nbsp;
Sithandra, Æon’s friend and a fellow member of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:55.200
Monican will help her cross the border, which is&nbsp;
the first step of the mission. The following day,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:59.920
Æon and Sithandra start the plan. They run&nbsp;
through the restricted premises of the Goodchild’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:05.200
residence, and are shot by several weapons planted&nbsp;
on the trees. Sithandra helps Æon to get through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:09.760
the traps and leaves her to complete the rest of&nbsp;
the mission alone, and waits outside for her.
&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:14.880
Inside the massive residence, we see Trevor&nbsp;
Goodchild talk to his brother and a co-member&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:19.760
of their government, Oren Goodchild. The two&nbsp;
talk about a system their world is working on.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.880
Trevor is actively trying to better the said&nbsp;
system, because it harms the people currently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:29.040
but Oren is in the favor of continuing the current&nbsp;
system even though it is hurting the people.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:35.200
Sometime later, Æon finds Trevor in an auditorium&nbsp;
practicing a speech. She comes in front of him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:41.440
and points her gun at him. However, before she can&nbsp;
pull the trigger, Trevor calls her Katherine. Æon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:46.880
gets a flashback of two people kissing and cannot&nbsp;
seem to shoot him. Someone from behind her knocks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:52.640
her unconscious. When she opens her eyes, she is&nbsp;
in a cell. One of the walls becomes transparent,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:57.760
revealing Trevor standing on the other side. Æon&nbsp;
asks him about calling her Katherine earlier,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:02.480
but Trevor doesn’t tell her why he did. He claims&nbsp;
it is good to see her again, and leaves. 
&nbsp;

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:08.400
A part on the wall reverses, offering her food&nbsp;
and water. But Æon suspects that the water is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:13.600
spiked by looking through her microscope embedded&nbsp;
in her eyes. She takes a sample of it with her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:17.840
She then calls on some marbles that she had&nbsp;
spread throughout the facility. The marbles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:23.600
explode creating an opening, through which Æon&nbsp;
runs away. Then we see Oren and other members of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:29.200
the government, who aren’t fond of Trevor’s idea,&nbsp;
talk about Æon’s escape. Oren dismisses them all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:34.400
but later meets Trevor’s secretary, Inari. As&nbsp;
they talk, we get to know that Oren was the one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:39.520
who manipulated the Monicans into wanting to kill&nbsp;
Trevor. He wants his brother dead and wants to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:44.800
it discreetly, so his death won’t track back&nbsp;
to him. Æon then goes to see Una’s boyfriend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:49.120
who tells her that the liquid she was given has a&nbsp;
message that will be told to her when she drinks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:54.640
it. Æon then drinks the liquid and Trevor talks to&nbsp;
her in her head. He asks her why she didn’t kill&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.640 --> 00:06:00.400
him earlier when she had a chance, and then he&nbsp;
calls her to a place. Æon rushes to go meet him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.880
She asks him for an answer to all this, but&nbsp;
he instead questions her why she is here,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:10.560
wanting her to remember the truth herself. In the&nbsp;
heat of the moment, the two kiss. After a while,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:16.560
Æon wakes up naked beside Trevor and is confused.&nbsp;
She doesn’t know what took over her earlier. 
&nbsp;

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:21.680
She strangles him and knocks him out. Æon&nbsp;
then finds a secret door leading to a library.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:26.800
An armor suddenly latches to her and brings&nbsp;
her to Trevor’s lab. She sees that he has been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:31.600
performing some kind of experiment. But just&nbsp;
then, she is confronted by Trevor’s personal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:37.200
security and assistant, Freya. Freya knows&nbsp;
her as the assassin sent to kill her boss,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:42.720
so she attacks her. The women get into an&nbsp;
intense fight, both equally skilled. In the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:47.360
Æon manages to escape through a secret opening.&nbsp;
When Trevor comes back to consciousness,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.360 --> 00:06:53.360
Freya tells him that she escaped and he asks&nbsp;
her to bring Æon back alive. Oren and the other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:58.320
officials see that Trevor and Freya have slept&nbsp;
together. They believe that Trevor has betrayed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:03.120
their trust by welcoming a member of the Monican,&nbsp;
so they want him to dethrone him altogether. 
&nbsp;

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:09.120
She goes back to meet Sithandra and tells her she&nbsp;
has aborted the mission. They get into an argument&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:14.560
after which, Æon ties Sithendra and runs&nbsp;
away. She sees the floating structure in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:20.640
sky through which the Goodchilds keep an eye on&nbsp;
the citizens. She climbs up to reach it. Inside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.640 --> 00:07:26.880
she sees a strange man controlling a strange&nbsp;
panel. The man sees Æon and welcomes her back. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:32.240
points towards a direction and disappears, leaving&nbsp;
a confused Æon to do whatever she likes. 
&nbsp;

00:07:32.240 --> 00:07:37.360
She goes to the panel and realises the device&nbsp;
has information about everyone in the city,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.800
so she searches for her sister’s name. As&nbsp;
it turns out Una has been reborn as Sasha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:48.080
Prillo. Æon is shocked, she gets her address&nbsp;
and runs to see her sister. Meanwhile, Sithandra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:53.680
informs Handler about Æon’s betrayal. Handler&nbsp;
assigns more members of the Monicans to eliminate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:59.200
Æon. Trevor reaches the flying object and meets&nbsp;
the man who happens to be the ship’s keeper.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:04.400
After knowing she went to see her sister,&nbsp;
Trevor runs there too. Æon holds her baby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:10.720
sister with teary eyes when Trevor reaches there.&nbsp;
He finally reveals to her the truth about Bregna.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:16.160
When the virus first spread four hundred years&nbsp;
ago, Trevor and a group of scientists developed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:22.480
the cure and saved some of the world. But the cure&nbsp;
had a terrible side effect, it made all the women&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:29.600
infertile. So, humans only had that one generation&nbsp;
to live. However, Trevor saved them when his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:35.680
cloning experiment was successful. He cloned the&nbsp;
DNA of every person alive and gave them a rebirth.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.400
Every person who has been born for the past four&nbsp;
hundred years is a clone of the ones who were&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:40.400 --> 00:08:46.720
cured. That is why people have strange dreams, the&nbsp;
dreams are the memories of their past lives. That&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.720 --> 00:08:51.680
is also the reason, the population of the place&nbsp;
has remained five million for all these centuries.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:57.840
When a person dies in the city, the ship’s keeper&nbsp;
recycles their DNA and assigns it to someone else.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.400 --> 00:09:03.600
The citizens are unknown to this and think&nbsp;
they have a natural pregnancy. But in reality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:08.800
the keeper of the floating ship finds a suitable&nbsp;
couple to impregnate and induce the woman with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:13.840
chemical pregnancy. When they visit the doctor&nbsp;
to see if they are pregnant, the cloned embryo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.640
is planted on her. That way, she gives birth to&nbsp;
a clone of someone who had recently died. 
&nbsp;

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:24.240
For the past seven generations, Trevor and Oren&nbsp;
have cloned themselves and taught their younger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:29.840
versions all the things they need to know. Then&nbsp;
Trevor also tells Æon that this method is not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:34.640
permanent and he has been looking for a way to&nbsp;
reinduce natural pregnancy for all these years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:40.560
Turns out, Una was subject to Trevor’s experiment&nbsp;
who had successfully been pregnant naturally,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:46.240
but Oren killed her because he wants the cloning&nbsp;
process to go on forever, so he can live forever.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:52.160
He wants to be immortal. As Æon looks at her&nbsp;
sister, the place is attacked by Oren’s men.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:57.040
But with Æon’s fighting skills, she protects&nbsp;
Trevor, and the two manage to run away from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:02.640
place, while being pursued by the men. They reach&nbsp;
a train station and escape by boarding a train,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:08.720
however, Trevor has been shot. Æon quickly takes&nbsp;
him to a nearby quiet area and takes the bullets&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:15.520
out of his body. She peels off her skin and puts&nbsp;
it on his, healing his wounds. Trevor then claims&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.520 --> 00:10:20.640
that they have to go to his lab to collect his&nbsp;
files on the experiment he performed on Una, so he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:25.920
could induce natural pregnancy again. Æon asks him&nbsp;
about their relationship and Trevor claims that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.920 --> 00:10:31.520
she was Katherine, his wife four hundred years&nbsp;
ago. Oren has told Trevor that she died because of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:38.080
the virus, but her DNA clone was protected. Æon is&nbsp;
beyond surprised but they do not have much time to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:44.160
chat. When the two reach his lab, they see Freya&nbsp;
dead and all his reports have been burned. 
&nbsp;

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:50.400
Trevor wants to run away from the city, but Æon&nbsp;
insists on doing one last task before leaving.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:55.760
She wants to destroy the floating ship because&nbsp;
she believes that cloning is playing with nature.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:59.600
Humans are supposed to die and she&nbsp;
doesn’t want that to change anymore.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.920
But before she can shoot the ship down,&nbsp;
Oren and his men surround the two.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.920 --> 00:11:08.160
At the same time, Sithandra and her&nbsp;
monicans team climb at a high point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:13.680
to assassinate Æon. Oren then reveals to Trevor&nbsp;
that more and more women started getting pregnant,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:18.480
not because of Trevor’s experiment, but because&nbsp;
they were healing from the cure’s side effects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.480 --> 00:11:24.880
So, he killed them all, including Una. That is why&nbsp;
the citizens have been disappearing mysteriously.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:30.800
He now plans to kill both of them and continue&nbsp;
the world of cloning. As they talk, Æon notices&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.800 --> 00:11:36.880
Sithandra far away. She uses telepathy technology&nbsp;
to convince her to help them. Sithendra and her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:42.800
group begin to shoot at the guards to save Trevor&nbsp;
and Æon. During the shootout, Oren is injured.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:48.880
Sithandra’s group manages to kill most of Oren’s&nbsp;
guards. However, an injured Oren shoots Sithandra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:48.880 --> 00:11:54.480
and drops her off the height, killing her. 
In the end, Trevor and Oren come face to face.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.480 --> 00:12:00.160
Æon shoots Oren dead when he points his gun at&nbsp;
Trevor. Æon then gets on the ship and explodes it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:00.160 --> 00:12:05.920
destroying the DNA clones stored in it. The&nbsp;
ship goes flying and lands harshly on the city’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:12.000
perimeter wall. The people see the outside world&nbsp;
for the first time. It seems fertile and full of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:18.080
vegetation, a land that can be inhabitable.&nbsp;
The movie ends as we see a glance of Æon and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:23.280
Trevor’s life four hundred years ago. 
